#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

// #taxon[Taxon]
// #title[Species restrict to S_n-sets]

Consider a species $X: "FinSet" -> "Set"$. By #local("00DE")[this] and by #local("00DF")[this], $X$ restricts to
$
  X_n:B S_n -> "Set".
$

In other words, $X$ is given precisely by what is does on each $B S_n$, since
$
  ("FinSet" -> "Set") ~= (Sigma (n:NN),("FinSet"_n -> "Set"))
$
